      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CANYA MAYHEM (1) struggled for best form latest, finishing 7th (30.19) in a S/E Group 1 at The Meadows. Has a strong winning record here at this journey including seven wins. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Has ability and can bounce back. CLEO'S STAR (2) has missed the frame at her last couple of starts but just a few runs back broke the clock when winning over 525m at The Meadows, taking a Free For All in an excellent 29.89. Top win three back and rates a key player again. OPAWA FANNIN (4) has a strong winning strike-rate here with two wins and a placing from five tries. In the money last time at this track (29.54) in a Special conditions race, finishing a one length third. With even luck and a clean start should be thereabouts. SHOWS PROMISE (3) in the money here last time and looks a top-three prospect again.",
